# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:12
translate italian english2_ed786fbf:

    # "At the beginning of the class, Mrs. McGee starts walking around the room, passing out the graded quizzes that we had taken last week."
    "All’inizio della lezione, la signora McGee inizia a girare per l’aula, distribuendo i quiz corretti che avevamo sostenuto la settimana scorsa."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:15
translate italian english2_731731ef:

    # "When she approaches my desk, she says my name."
    "Quando si avvicina al mio banco, mi chiama per nome."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:16
translate italian english2_952b41a4:

    # et "[pcname]."
    et "[pcname]."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:17
translate italian english2_844a3a46:

    # "She puts the graded quiz down on my desk."
    "Appoggia il quiz corretto sul mio banco."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:18
translate italian english2_6711b135:

    # "An A is marked at the top of it."
    "In cima c’è una A."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:19
translate italian english2_2f82f17f:

    # "Perfect! I aced it."
    "Perfetto! L’ho superato a pieni voti."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:21
translate italian english2_96a25b02:

    # "Mrs. McGee leans over in front of me. I can see her breasts shift around underneath her dress as she leans over."
    "La signora McGee si sporge davanti a me. Vedo il suo seno muoversi sotto il vestito mentre si china."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:22
translate italian english2_54e1945a:

    # "Part of me just wants to reach out and grab them."
    "Una parte di me vorrebbe semplicemente allungare la mano e afferrarlo."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:23
translate italian english2_b8ddb40c:

    # et "Great job, [pcname]. Best grade in the class."
    et "Ottimo lavoro, [pcname]. Il voto più alto della classe."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:24
translate italian english2_248280db:

    # et "Keep it up."
    et "Continua così."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:29
translate italian english2_e99dc4e7:

    # "When she walks away, I notice Juliana looking over at me."
    "Quando si allontana, noto che Juliana mi sta guardando."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:31
translate italian english2_14552a74:

    # "When she walks away, I notice the girl sitting near me looking over. Juliana, I think her name is."
    "Quando si allontana, noto che la ragazza seduta vicino a me mi sta guardando. Juliana, credo si chiami così."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:32
translate italian english2_27e7f98d:

    # "I can't tell if she is impressed, or jealous, or annoyed."
    "Non riesco a capire se sia impressionata, gelosa o infastidita."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:33
translate italian english2_650a4a33:

    # "I notice that her quiz has an A at the top as well, but it is followed by a minus."
    "Noto che anche il suo compito ha una A in cima, ma è seguita da un segno meno."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:34
translate italian english2_2c10dc66:

    # "Just barely less than mine."
    "Appena un po’ inferiore al mio."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:36
translate italian english2_c3bd087a:

    # "After the quizzes are all passed out, Mrs. McGee goes over the answers on them, then we move on with our normal class."
    "Dopo che tutti i compiti sono stati distribuiti, la signora McGee esamina le risposte, poi proseguiamo con la normale lezione."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:37
translate italian english2_2e9ad06e:

    # "Nothing else interesting happens in my other classes throughout the day. Just seemingly endless monotonous studying."
    "Non succede nient’altro di interessante nelle altre mie lezioni durante la giornata. Solo uno studio monotono che sembra non finire mai."

# game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:38
translate italian english2_231b2b98:

    # "Then, when my brain is just about mush, it's time to go to work."
    "Poi, quando il mio cervello è ormai ridotto a poltiglia, è ora di andare al lavoro."

translate italian strings:

    # game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:2
    old "You have finished your English Homework"
    new "Hai finito i compiti di inglese"

    # game/Scenes/School/English/english2.rpy:3
    old "Mrs. McGee will notice you the next time in her class."
    new "La signora McGee te lo noterà la prossima volta durante la sua lezione."

